          "worked": "Treat CC and LL as single elements. Arrange CC, LL, A and S in $4!$ ways, creating five gaps. Place the two U’s in different gaps, dividing by $2!$ because they are identical.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=4!\\times\\frac{5\\times4}{2!}\\\\N&=240\\end{align*}$$",
